00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.890
Panicking won't help.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.310
Calm down.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.140
I need to hurry.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.890
Why should the captain have to—

