00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.160
Mr. Seric...

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.870
So you've found out, then.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:53.870
Yes.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:58.920
I've checked all the records of Vagan's past operation plans and their execution.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:05.340
To seize Earth, and create an Eden where the Vagan people could live in peace.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:10.300
A utopia free of war and disease, where people could be truly human.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:15.270
I've given up everything to reach that utopia! {tell me again why utopia is capitalized because there's no reason it shoudl be}

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:19.770
