00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.240
I, who have believed in you for so long?!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:33.080
Lord Ezelcant, please tell me the truth.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:35.580
Zeheart...

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:43.500
I wanted to turn Earth, our place of origin, into an Eden

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:46.010
where people could live like humans again.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:51.930
And so I've been selecting a superior race to live in that Eden.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.100
Selecting...?

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.770
Selecting a race worthy to carry on into the future.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.020
So people can truly be human.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.570
That was Project Eden, which would open the door to the new world.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:08.440
In other words, the creation of a new human race.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.320
Are you trying to become God?!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.120
Can't you understand, Zeheart?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:18.290
Selecting a human race? Of course I can't understand!

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:24.170
Even if Vagan <i>does</i> take back Earth, the same thing will just happen again.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.630
