00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.090
We'd act like animals, fighting out of instinct.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:41.640
To guide people to a higher level, to make a better world, someone must choose.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.440
And I've been making those choices.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:51.530
The better world you speak of is just a dictatorship made for you to rule!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:55.240
You'll become just another one of
 the tyrannical rulers in Earth's history!{oh man, what's with teh script this week}

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:56.620
No!

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.660
What I want to make isn't a dictatorship!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.830
It's the future of humanity!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.210
What kind of a place is Earth? {check prev eps}

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:10.970
Hey, Dad... I'd like to be reborn on Earth.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:16.260
And of course, I want Mom and Dad to be there too.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:22.440
My son's parting words were the trigger.{the trigger}

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:26.150
To gain the power to fight the Earth Federation,

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.980
I read the history of warfare recorded in the EXA-DB.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:36.160
The long history of war that began when humanity migrated into space.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:46.330
The Earth recorded within was far from a utopia. It was truly a planet of fools.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:52.170
As people left Mother Earth and history passed,

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:57.140
