00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:04.270
In all this time, humanity has almost forgotten how to be human.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:10.570
I realized that unless I created a new human race, a true utopia would never be realized.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.320
Lord Ezelcant!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.330
