00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:32.050
But you can't...

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.050
Listen, Zeheart.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.220
Unless we destroy the past and move on, we can't create the future.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.970
I don't want to be a ruler.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.430
I want to make humanity evolve,

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.600
so it won't repeat its foolish history.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:51.400
That is my... final wish.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.230
Lord Ezelcant...

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.860
Zeheart...

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.950
I'm giving you full authority over Project Eden.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.910
You will lead all of Vagan!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.370
Zeheart...

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:11.420
If you think me mad, then so be it.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:15.590
Now that you know everything, will you follow me?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:18.010
In my madness...

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.590
Lord Ezelcant.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:24.430
Are you telling me to become God and create a new humanity?

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:26.350
Not God.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:32.310
You'll become a light... illuminating humanity's future.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.900
A light...?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.700
You understand, Zeheart?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.360
Lord Ezelcant.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.710
I, Zeheart Galette, shall carry on your will.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.600
Come, it's time to wake up.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.970
Can you hear me?

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.730
Your name is Zera Gins.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:11.270
Vagan's greatest pilot.

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:20.490
The data we've seized gives us a partial picture of the enemy base's interior.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:24.530
The Vagan space fortress that attacked the Earth.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.040
It's called La Gramis.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.500
It's composed of many spherical blocks,

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.340
and can change its shape to suit the situation.

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.500
La Gramis...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.470
Our next objective is to attack La Gramis.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:46.470
Former Commander-in-Chief Flit Asuno will be commanding all of our fleets this time.{algreus is so whipped}

