00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.060
All the paperwork is in order.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:04.410
Father.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.660
What is it?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:11.710
We'll be joining the attack on the enemy fortress La Gramis.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.330
Do as you please.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.000
Right.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.880
Algreus?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:21.670
What is it?

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.260
A new report.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.600
The prisoners at the base will be transferred to Earth.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.350
Transferred?

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:31.390
If they're Vagan prisoners, then just execute them all!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:37.690
Commander... I understand how you feel, but we can't do that.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:41.240
Following standard procedure, we will transfer them after interrogation.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:42.860
<i>Fine, suit yourself!</i>

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.490
Father, why do you hate them so much?

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.620
They're a cruel enemy.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.420
Therefore we should treat them in kind.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:58.670
During the last battle, you tried to use a plasma diver missile.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.800
That weapon's still in development, and its power is unknown.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.640
There was a chance your own forces could have been hurt as well.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.180
This is no ordinary war.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.810
We're subduing the demons who threaten Earth!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.180
We must eliminate every last one of them!

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:16.350
You can't do that!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:19.190
You're letting your emotions guide this war!{You're making war based on your own emotions!}

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.400
You can't...

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.320
Dad?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.110
Let me tell you, Asemu.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.860
A pirate like you has no right to talk about justice!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:33.580
No matter what you people say, I'm going to exterminate the Vagan myself!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.540
But why, Grandpa?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.540
Kio...

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:38.830
Why are you saying that?

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.210
Let's stop this, Grandpa.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.420
Let's end this war here!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.930
Dad, Grandpa, you've been fighting forever.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.970
But fighting for what?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.220
Let's find a way where we don't have to fight!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.560
There must be a way.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.640
There has to be!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.520
They killed my family.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:03.320
They took the things I cared for!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.410
Whatever reasons they had, they'll always be evil in my eyes.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.780
If we don't fight, there'll be more unhappy people like me.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:14.450
But... even so...

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:17.080
I believe the day will come when we can understand each other. {I want to kill Kio}{UNDERSTANDING!}

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.000
Understand each other...?{nakama time}

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.880
Kio, that's enough!

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.460
Go now.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:27.970
No matter what you say, Grandpa, I won't change my ideas!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.390
Kio, I'm determined to defeat Vagan.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.640
I'll become the savior who defeats them. {wow is he stil going on about this}

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.730
For the sake of all the people I couldn't protect.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.690
Grandpa, you're just driven by hatred!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.400
You're no savior!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.860
What?!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.820
You're nothing like one!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:52.370
Father... consider Kio's words.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:57.290
I understand we're in a position where we can't avoid fighting.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.870
But Kio...

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:05.170
Kio's words... they're words that everyone wanted to say, but couldn't.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:12.550
The fate of the Earth, and of humanity, rests with your decision.

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.520
<i>There were people I couldn't protect...</i>

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.490
<i>People I couldn't protect...</i>

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:40.160
<i>I swore I'd defeat the enemy, and be the savior who rescues everyone.</i>

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.040
<i>No matter what I had to do. {no matter what methods i had to use}</i>

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.420
The operation orders have been given.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:53.840
Our ship is setting a course for the enemy fortress La Gramis!

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:58.520
The Baranoke will head for the space fortress La Gramis.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.750
Launch the Fa Zard!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.800
Set a course for La Gramis!

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.730
Commander Ocramud.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.900
Master Zeheart's fleet is headed our way.{it's takeda shingen! oyakata-sama!}

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.810
Yes, I've heard.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:53.450
I've received information that the enemy is finally going to attack La Gramis.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:58.330
So is the Federation planning to attack La Gramis head on?

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.240
So it seems.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.210
Ignorance really is bliss!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:09.670
We'll show those Federation fools the true terror of La Gramis.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.010
Will the enemy come?

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.180
They will.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:20.260
The Earth Federation cannot win unless La Gramis falls.

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:25.440
And this could the the critical battle that will end this war.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:29.860
<i>If we can win this battle, Master Zeheart's wish will come true.</i>

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.650
By the way, Leil.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.700
How goes the search for the EXA-DB?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.740
Sir!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:41.240
There's a good chance it's hidden in an asteroid field in the Earth Sphere.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.540
We're gradually narrowing down the point.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.290
I see.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.710
But there's one report that caught my attention.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:48.880
What was it?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:54.840
One of the teams seeking the EXA-DB encountered an unknown mobile suit.

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.510
Unknown?

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.840
What do you mean?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.930
A type of mobile suit belonging to neither the Federation nor Vagan.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.430
They said it was five or six times the size of a normal mobile suit.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:11.730
It's rumored to be a killer monster created by the EXA-DB to protect itself.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.900
Created by the EXA-DB...?

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.530
But they lost track of it immediately after.{Oh man. seriously who is doing this?}

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.030
They probably just misidentified some warship wreckage or something.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.080
Is that asteroid field close to us?

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.830
Yes, I believe so.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.750
Leil, I want to test the Gundam {legolas}Legilis before we reach {helm's deep}La Gramis.

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.500
Get it ready.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.630
Yes, sir.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.220
I'll go with you.

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.090
No, I'll go alone.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.140
But...

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.430
It's just a rumor.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.430
But if it's really there...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:51.610
I'd like to challenge this killer monster the EXA-DB created against the Gundam Legilis .

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:02.740
Kio!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:04.240
You look down.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.660
Wendy... {havent seen her in ages, females never show up}{we saw quite a bit of fram}

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.290
What's wrong?

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:08.960
You aren't acting like yourself.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.130
I don't understand my grandpa.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.250
He used to be so nice...{and then he took a Vagan attack to the knee}{NO.}

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:19.130
And now I can't understand what he's thinking.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:23.300
I can't believe that what he's trying to do is right.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.680
The Vagan are human beings too.

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.270
If one of them dies, somebody will be sad.{when you kill someone, they die!}

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.980
They're human just like us.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:33.400
Kio.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.150
Don't worry so much.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.820
I think someday you'll understand each other.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.860
Because you're family.{and one day... the two of them will be too XD so obvious}

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.450
But right now, Grandpa and I can't...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.370
With this machine, you won't need the control mask.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:56.750
The Gundam Legilis's ability to sympathetically
 resonate with X-Rounders is off the scale.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:20:00.920
Why not try throwing all your power at it?

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:03.590
All my power at the Gundam...

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:07.760
But the stress on your body will increase accordingly.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.770
So don't overdo it.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:11.940
Understood. I'll be careful.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.990
So this is a Gundam?

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:26.120
<i>How is it, Master Zeheart?</i>

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.740
It was a gift from Lord Ezelcant.{a unit entrusted to me by blahblah}

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.950
I'll try to master it no matter what.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.210
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.750
<i>Master Zeheart, take care.</i>

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:35.830
Yeah.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.760
Gundam Legilis, the launch port is all set. {the launch point is all set}

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.550
Activating X-Transmitter.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.510
Starting up at level four.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.060
Zeheart Galette, Gundam Legilis, launching!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.890
So this is...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.160
This is a Gundam?

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.250
What's that?

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.850
Go, bits!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.330
How can it move so fast... when it's so large?!{what agility/movement, even though it's so big}

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:55.620
Could that be...

00:21:58.500 --> 00:21:59.580
Very well.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.340
Good timing, then.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:07.180
If the EXA-DB created it, then it's a symbol of humanity's mistakes.

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:09.890
A trial given to me by God!

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:16.100
<i>You'll become a light... illuminating humanity's future.</i>

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:19.650
I'll defeat it, and carry on Lord Ezelcant's will!

